WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:10.413
Registry as a Service gives accredited bodies, associations, large buyers and platform providers a public evidence register under their own brand.

2
00:00:10.363 --> 00:00:21.313
It uses a shared SHA-256 chain, evidence grades, timestamp anchors and revocation history, so anyone can check a record without an account.

3
00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:25.558
APIs and exports support audits and existing systems.

4
00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:30.532
The service does not transfer accreditation or certify tenant-supplied data.

5
00:00:30.532 --> 00:00:36.274
Each tenant remains responsible for its own conclusions, conduct and reputation.

6
00:00:36.274 --> 00:00:44.920
Carbon Verify provides the public evidence infrastructure, while public verification stays free and independently reproducible.
